You know how you sometimes "avoid" a trap if you step on the square?  I
think pets are doing the same thing.  If you keep on doing it (and it can
take a while), it will work.  IF I don't have magic resistance, I'll take
the first pet that's at all better then a cat/dog.  If I do, I'll try for
something bigger, but when my patience gets thin, I"ll say "An ape is ok,
let's go!"  It helps if the trap is near walls - then you can get the pet
into the trap more easily.

Also, you don't *need* a pet titan to have an awesome pet.  For example,
Water Trolls are great - they dish out lots of damage, can't drown, and
regenerate!

